  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11724,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 51870,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1673",
   "x": 2069.9999999999995,
   "y": 1717.0,
   "width": 476.00000000000034,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. パスの直引きは 0 になった。残りは MakeContext の中の2本",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. パスの直引きは 0 になった。残りは MakeContext の中の2本",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11731,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 51901,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1674",
   "x": 2069.9999999999995,
   "y": 1737.0,
   "width": 726.4000000000007,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    RenderGraph::MakeContext が MainEngine と RayEngine を Instance() で引いて詰める。\n    GraphicsEngine から RayEngine / ParticleBufferManager を受け取れば\n    描画層の中でシングルトンを引くのは GraphicsEngine の入口だけになる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    RenderGraph::MakeContext が MainEngine と RayEngine を Instance() で引いて詰める。\n    GraphicsEngine から RayEngine / ParticleBufferManager を受け取れば\n    描画層の中でシングルトンを引くのは GraphicsEngine の入口だけになる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11738,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 51932,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1675",
   "x": 2069.9999999999995,
   "y": 1817.0,
   "width": 484.2000000000003,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. GraphicsEngine → SceneManager / GameManager は層の逆流",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. GraphicsEngine → SceneManager / GameManager は層の逆流",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11745,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 51963,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1676",
   "x": 2069.9999999999995,
   "y": 1837.0,
   "width": 510.3999999999999,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    GameManager::Draw() は「テスト」とコメントされた呼び出し。\n    BLAS の初期化要求はワールドのリソースから読んでいるので、\n    シーン更新側から積むか、Submit の引数で World を渡したい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    GameManager::Draw() は「テスト」とコメントされた呼び出し。\n    BLAS の初期化要求はワールドのリソースから読んでいるので、\n    シーン更新側から積むか、Submit の引数で World を渡したい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11752,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 51994,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1677",
   "x": 2069.9999999999995,
   "y": 1917.0,
   "width": 447.2000000000004,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "3. ParticleSimulation / GPUParticlePool → MainEngine",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3. ParticleSimulation / GPUParticlePool → MainEngine",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11759,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 52025,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1678",
   "x": 2069.9999999999995,
   "y": 1937.0,
   "width": 513.8000000000002,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    欲しいのは ParticleBufferManager・デルタタイム・遅延解放。\n    ExecuteParticleSimulation の引数か PassContext で足りる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    欲しいのは ParticleBufferManager・デルタタイム・遅延解放。\n    ExecuteParticleSimulation の引数か PassContext で足りる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11766,
